==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Nazousagi (Enemy)|Nazousagi]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

